{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/54","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/54/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/54/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/54/events","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/54","id":2116961088,"node_id":"I_kwDOKDql7s5-LkNA","number":54,"title":"PHPicker NSUrl is only a temporary file","user":{"login":"iruizmar","id":11753209,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzUzMjA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11753209?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iruizmar","html_url":"https://github.com/iruizmar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iruizmar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iruizmar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iruizmar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iruizmar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iruizmar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iruizmar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iruizmar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iruizmar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iruizmar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":13,"created_at":"2024-02-04T08:43:35Z","updated_at":"2024-05-29T18:06:20Z","closed_at":"2024-05-29T14:34:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"According to PHPicker's documentation, the NSUrl returned on the `loadFileRepresetion` handler is only temporary and will get deleted when the callback finishes:\r\n\r\nhttps://developer.apple.com/documentation/foundation/nsitemprovider/2888338-loadfilerepresentation/#discussion\r\n\r\n```\r\nThis method writes a copy of the file’s data to a temporary file, which the system deletes when the completion handler returns.\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis means that if you get the `byteArray` right away from the `KmpFile` on the callback in compose everything will work as expected, but if you store the `KmpFile` for a future usage, for instance uploading to the server, this won't work.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what's the best solution. WDYT?","closed_by":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/54/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/54/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comm